# Implementation rules

- Match existing codebase conventions — read similar files first
- Minimal diff: fix intent = root cause only, no drive-by refactors
- improve intent = no behavior change; tests are frozen spec
- Atomic commits per task with clear messages
- Add/update tests for behavior changes
- Do not edit `specs/` directly during execute — use change deltas, merge on archive

## Executor context budget

On `/execute`, load ONLY:
- One unchecked task from `tasks.md`
- `design.md` for active change
- `constitution.md`
- Relevant `@files` — not full plan-team chat history
